                        "sense_id": "c1dc8a20-8715-3b90-aed4-b85c76f27060",
                        "entry_id": "8ee50947-d431-3b22-92b9-150592482eae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "an architectural grotesque, especially a door knocker"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic",
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "17972b3a-819d-37c8-ac39-e98d9ca5c37f",
                        "entry_id": "8ee50947-d431-3b22-92b9-150592482eae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "kid, brat"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d638d95-7c74-4782-82ba-b823fc332d72",
                                "sense_id": "17972b3a-819d-37c8-ac39-e98d9ca5c37f",
                                "text": "Rentré chez eux, le marmot fut gâté comme un prince. Sa mère le nourrissait de confitures; son père le laissait courir sans souliers, et, pour faire le philosophe, disait même qu'il pouvait bien aller tout nu, comme les enfants des bêtes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ffd3d9ce-0608-4c86-87c7-899f936981b3",
                                "sense_id": "17972b3a-819d-37c8-ac39-e98d9ca5c37f",
                                "text": "— C’est bon. Et en lui posant des questions sur elle, tu finis par apprendre qu’elle a un marmot. Tu fais quoi ?",
                                "translation": "\"That's alright. And by asking her questions about her, you end up learning she has a kid. What are you doing?\"",
                                "english": "\"That's alright. And by asking her questions about her, you end up learning she has a kid. What are you doing?\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
